worker_module_budget
  module "formal_ai_worker_release_timeline.js"
  ceiling 273
  rationale "Film timeline queries validate a scoped publisher result before formatting supported release dates and announced titles. The parser also serves historical captures supplied by tests. The open-series subject guard twins Rust `names_a_series` (issue #1637), so a directive such as 'list' is never taken for a series name."
